    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Because the <strong>intermolecular forces</strong> in simple molecular substances are <strong>weak</strong>, it requires less energy (heat) to separate molecules. This results in relatively <strong>low melting and boiling points</strong> compared to substances with stronger forces, like ionic or metallic compounds.</p>",
